.TH GETRLIMIT 3
.SH NAME
getrlimit, setrlimit \- libc wrappers for native process limits
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <sys/resource.h>
.PP
.BI "int getrlimit(int " resource ", struct rlimit *" limit ");"
.br
.BI "int setrlimit(int " resource ", const struct rlimit *" limit ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The wrappers invoke Astia's native resource-limit ABI and translate its
negative errno return into the standard libc -1/errno convention.  The
rlimit fields are 64-bit values.  RLIM_INFINITY is UINT64_MAX.
.SH NOTES
The implementation provides RLIMIT_NOFILE and RLIMIT_AS.  It never delegates
to the host operating system's resource-limit API.
